T1036	Entity 140819 140822	She
T1038	Quotation 140918 141028	"Tom Sawyer, you are just as mean as you can be, to sneak up on a person and look at what they're looking at."
T1039	Quotation 141029 141076	"How could I know you was looking at anything?"
T1040	Quotation 141077 141258	"You ought to be ashamed of yourself, Tom Sawyer; you know you're going to tell on me, and oh, what shall I do, what shall I do! I'll be whipped, and I never was whipped in school."
T1041	Entity 141264 141267	she
T1042	Cue 141296 141300	said
T1043	Quotation 141302 141428	"BE so mean if you want to! I know something that's going to happen. You just wait and you'll see! Hateful, hateful, hateful!"
T1045	Entity 141557 141559	he
T1046	Cue 141560 141564	said
T1047	Entity 141568 141575	himself
T1048	Quotation 141577 142292	"What a curious kind of a fool a girl is! Never been licked in school! Shucks! What's a licking! That's just like a girl-- they're so thin-skinned and chicken-hearted. Well, of course I ain't going to tell old Dobbins on this little fool, because there's other ways of getting even on her, that ain't so mean; but what of it? Old Dobbins will ask who it was tore his book. Nobody'll answer. Then he'll do just the way he always does-- ask first one and then t'other, and when he comes to the right girl he'll know it, without any telling. Girls' faces always tell on them. They ain't got any backbone. She'll get licked. Well, it's a kind of a tight place for Becky Thatcher, because there ain't any way out of it."
T1049	Entity 142293 142296	Tom
T1050	Cue 142340 142345	added
T1051	Quotation 142347 142431	"All right, though; she'd like to see me in just such a fix-- let her sweat it out!"
T1052	Cue 143518 143522	said
T1053	Entity 143523 143526	she
T1054	Entity 143530 143537	herself
T1055	Quotation 143539 143631	"he'll tell about me tearing the picture sure. I wouldn't say a word, not to save his life!"
T1056	Quotation 144975 145006	There was no help for Becky now
T1057	Entity 145008 145010	he
T1058	Cue 145011 145015	said
T1059	Entity 145050 145060	the school
T1060	Entity 145242 145244	he
T1061	Cue 145245 145250	spoke
T1062	Quotation 145252 145273	"Who tore this book?"
T1063	Entity 145355 145365	the master
T1064	Quotation 145411 145453	"Benjamin Rogers, did you tear this book?"
T1065	Quotation 145479 145504	"Joseph Harper, did you?"
T1066	Entity 145610 145620	The master
T1067	Quotation 145695 145710	"Amy Lawrence?"
T1068	Quotation 145732 145748	"Gracie Miller?"
T1069	Quotation 145764 145796	"Susan Harper, did you do this?"
T1070	Quotation 145951 145969	"Rebecca Thatcher"
T1071	Entity 145986 145989	her
T1072	Quotation 146025 146065	"did you tear-- no, look me in the face"
T1073	Quotation 146095 146120	"did you tear this book?"
T1074	Entity 146172 146174	He
T1075	Cue 146198 146205	shouted
T1076	Quotation 146208 146220	"I done it!"
T1077	Entity 146900 146903	Tom
T1078	Entity 147170 147175	Becky
T1080	Quotation 147223 147256	"Tom, how COULD you be so noble!"
